                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "The safest bet in Washington is that so-called \"moderate\" Republicans will always fold to Trump.\n\nThey never stand up to him when it counts. \n\nThis summer, he asked them to support the biggest health care cuts in American history, and they passed it with glee. https://t.co/OAWs1cK6Q2",
