                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "Trump has had a \"concept\" of a health care plan for 10 years now. But we finally saw his real plan this summer with Republicans\u2019 Big Ugly Law.\n\nHe cut health care for millions of Americans and raised premiums for tens of millions more to fund tax breaks for billionaires. https://t.co/SQv65MZRJ7",
