                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As your Congressman \u2014 and as the Lead Democrat on @HouseBudgetDems \u2014 I\u2019m proud to lead these fights every day to keep the main thing the main thing: ensuring families in Philly and across Pennsylvania can afford what they need and get the health care they deserve.",
