                "text": "Trump called the cost-of-living crisis a \"con,\" but now he's in Pennsylvania claiming he's lowering costs.\n\nHis empty promises are the real con \u2014 and Pennsylvanians aren't buying it.\n\nThis is the same guy raising prices with his tariff taxes and taking health care from Americans. https://t.co/aKg4bwcigJ",
