                "text": "Trump continues to raise prices on Americans with his tariff taxes.\n\nThe labor market is flailing on his watch.\n\nRepublicans are kicking millions off their health care.\n\nToday's Fed decision is yet another sign that Trump's economy is not working for regular Americans.",
